        "description": "__Height:__ 170 cm (5'7\")\n__Ability:__ Beast Beneath the Moonlight\n\nHe came to Yokohama after being driven out of a poor orphanage that was attacked by a man-eating tiger. On the verge of starvation, he meets [Dazai](https://anilist.co/character/89198/Dazai-Osamu) and gets a job helping at the detective agency. Because he's never had friends or family and was labeled as \"useless,\" he lacks self-confidence.",
